silm:instances_papers_04_forge_sections_04_layered_sequencing_concrete_anchor_6#mittensforgefactorizationsquare silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensForgeFactorizationSquare is In section 'Layered Sequencing' the bare symbol |[infonode]| (L_6) anchors to MittensForgeFactorizationSquare: The commutative square: manifest hom-profile (top edge) equals trace fingerprint (bottom edge) under the forge factorization; if it fails to commute, the source is rejected at admission." .
